							<h3>Software Engineer – Co-founder</h3>
							<p>I co-founded and launched Se za Kompjuteri, a hardware marketplace for a community of over 15,000 PC enthusiasts. I continue to develop the platform, spanning architecture, frontend and backend development, database design, and a PC build planner combining marketplace listings with products from local retailers.</p>
