									<span class="project-meta__release project-meta__release--public">Public release</span>
								</div>
								<h3>Gluj-Drive</h3>
								<p>Gluj-Drive turns a Windows PC into a private photo and video library for LAN or Tailscale access. It indexes existing files in place without duplication, provides responsive galleries for browsing, streaming, and uploads, and offers optional local TinyCLIP semantic image search. Built with ASP.NET Core, React, and TypeScript, it is maintained with a focus on security and stability.</p>
							</div>
							<ul class="project-tags"><li>C#</li><li>.NET 10</li><li>ASP.NET Core</li><li>React</li><li>TypeScript</li><li>TinyCLIP</li><li>GitHub Actions</li><li>Windows x64</li><li>Apache 2.0</li></ul>
							<div class="project-actions" aria-label="Gluj-Drive links">
